      "handle": "shipping",
      "title": "Shipping & Returns",
      "body": "<h2>Shipping</h2><p>Delivery in Egypt usually takes 2–4 days after your order is dispatched. For pre-orders, we’ll contact you when your item is ready; no dispatch date is promised yet.</p><h2>Returns &amp; exchanges</h2><p>You can request a return or size exchange within 14 days of delivery. Items must be unworn, unused and in new condition, suitable to be sold again. Size exchanges are welcome, subject to availability.</p><p>To arrange a return or exchange, please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> with your order details.</p>"
    },
    {
      "handle": "about-us",
      "title": "About Us",
      "body": "<p class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer\"><strong>UNLISTED is built around one simple idea: good taste doesn’t need to be loud.</strong><span class=\"PDq2pG_selectionAnchor\"></span></p>\n<p>We create everyday pieces with a clean, considered approach focusing on fit, fabric, detail, and how each piece actually feels when worn.</p>\n<p>Our first drop is designed in Egypt and made in limited quantities, with every release kept intentional rather than overproduced.</p>\n<p><strong>A Matter of Taste.</strong></p>"
    },
